om2
note signed div / rem by 2^k for long, int, short, byte: one line per divisor, a hash of q and r over
note 4096 xorshift values plus each width's boundaries; the SDIV build is the oracle (gate20)
global obuf uchar 32
fn putnum v ulong to void
put obuf 31 10
p = ulong 31
x = v
while gt x 9
p = sub p 1
put obuf p uchar add rem x 10 48
x = div x 10
end
p = sub p 1
put obuf p uchar add x 48
w = write 1 obuf p sub 32 p
end
fn mix h ulong q ulong r ulong to ulong
a = xor h q
a = mul a 1099511628211
a = xor a r
ret mul a 1099511628211
end
